   239	 * and the score reaches `MIN_COUNTERPART_SIMILARITY`. Ties fail the margin, so
   240	 * duplicated boilerplate on either side pairs with nothing. Each Reference
   241	 * paragraph is used at most once. Order-free: a reordered pair still meets.
   242	 */
